    verification githubGestureSubstanceRetroGate : Test { :>> id = "0d49ad33-25fe-44af-a96e-b4774d15ba17"; :>> title = "Sprint 439 retro gate (autonomous, D0049)"; :>> createdAt = "2026-08-24"; :>> createdBy = "claudeFable5"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::analyze; :>> procedureText = "Autonomous retro (D0049). AVOIDABLE-ISSUE SCAN under rcRecurrence: the substance-scanner-meets-real-input class now has three instances; the durable fix is a property test over quotes_conversational_words (charter candidate), and the immediate lesson - a new recording CHANNEL must be dry-run against the substance guard with a REALISTIC minimal gesture before it goes live, which the D0208 answer effectively did for us the hard way. WELL: the channel exercising itself found the gap in ITSELF within hours of going live, and nothing was lost because the guard fires before the push. Estimate 1 pt, delivered 1."; }
